.git
*.db
runkite
.cursor/
.github/
plans/
typescript/*/dist/
# Bare "node_modules/"/".venv" only matched the repo root, not per-example
# dirs like examples/*/node_modules -- **/ matches at any depth, so a
# locally-built image (unlike CI's fresh checkout) can't accidentally bake
# in a dev machine's installed example deps (and their CVEs) alongside the
# examples/*/langgraph.json files the image genuinely needs.
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# admin-ui's source/toolchain isn't needed in the Docker build context --
# its build output is committed straight into internal/adminui/dist/
# (see internal/adminui/adminui.go), which the Go build already picks up.
admin-ui/
